      "content": "idk i dont think a barista is gonna make a difference. it feels way deeper than that. it's more like... even if i did talk to them, it wouldn't matter. like it's not even worth the energy to try and exist in a space where nothing sticks. it's just exhausting to keep pretending that being seen actually matters.",
