      "content": "idk, even the \"small things\" feel pointless. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen but nothing ever does. everyone else seems to have a place, a reason to be here, and i'm just... drifting. if i just stopped showing up or something, would anyone even notice? or would it just be like i was never even here to begin with?",
